  "description": "Anakin Skywalker travels to Tatooine with Padmé Amidala and learns, from members of the moisture-farming Lars family, that his mother has been captured by Sand People. Shmi dies in her son's arms and the volatile young man gives into dark rage, slaughtering all Tuskens in his midst. Meanwhile, on Geonosis, Obi-Wan overhears a meeting between Count Dooku and the leaders of the Commerce Guilds, who are not only behind the separatist movement, but are responsible for building up a new droid army. Kenobi also learns that it was Viceroy Nute Gunray who ordered the assassination of Amidala, as revenge for the defeat of the Trade Federation at the Battle of Naboo."
